@startuml
title Module Readiness Evaluation
start
:Load scoped readiness requirements;
:Exclude not-applicable requirements;
:Calculate weighted completion;
if (Incomplete blocking item?) then (yes)
  :Status = blocked;
elseif (100 percent complete?) then (yes)
  :Status = ready;
elseif (Score at least 60?) then (yes)
  :Status = partially ready;
else (no)
  :Status = at risk;
endif
:Store score, status, blocking count, evaluator and time;
stop
@enduml
